# Client Environment Variables (Vite)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The canonical reference for ALL variables is /.env.example
# at the project root.
#
# Copy the client-relevant variable below to client/.env (or
# client/.env.local) for local development without Docker.
#
# Variable consumed by the client:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL   — API base URL baked into the JS bundle at build time.
#                         Local dev:  http://localhost:3001
#                         Production: https://api.yourdomain.com
